  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-07-15T07:23:22.236Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Dear developers, \nHi! How's it going? :) \n\nActually, the trouble of mine is that my PC is not powerful enough to play VRChat on it. So I suggest to  make the game available on mobile devices, such as smartphones, tablets etc. It's like playing on PC without trackers. But it's possible to create a <<hand conrolling mode>>,which allows you to move your hands, but you stand at one place(mode can be turned off, of course).\n\nThere are a lot of fans playing <<clones>> of your game on their mobile devices (Virtual Droid, for example). Just imagine how happy we'll be if there was a mobile version of VRChat!\n\nAnd what about you, players? Do you want to see VRChat as a portable thing? Guess you do. Tell me what do you think about it. \n\nThanks! :)",
